        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Events: 1976 German Grand Prix\n- People: James Hunt, Niki Lauda\n- Places: Nürburgring\n- Topics: 1976 Formula One season, racing helmets, media commentary, business\n\nFacts:\n- The 1976 German Grand Prix was the tenth round of the 1976 Formula One season.\n- The 1976 German Grand Prix was a 14-lap race.\n- James Hunt won the 1976 German Grand Prix.\n- At the 1976 German Grand Prix at the Nürburgring, world champion driver Niki Lauda crashed and barely escaped alive.\n- James Hunt retired from racing in 1979.\n- After retiring from racing in 1979, James Hunt became a media commentator and businessman.",
